= Anatomy practical examination
{scope}
{title2=No. I.}

Original volume: <Examination papers for the Degree of Bachelor of Medicine by the University of Oxford (1864–1867)>. https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/Examination_papers_for_the_Degree_of_Bachelor_of_medicine_-_1864-67_(IA_b24757810).pdf#page=77[Open the original paper in the scanned volume]. Scanned volume: PDF page 77, December 1867.

